3", "message": "Added a README file.", "created_at": "2014-11-04T20:55:32Z", "repo": "BioBatch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9dd639dfe4ee2067912515e0b494d85dc8da4fb1", "message": "Merge branch 'master' of github.com:TimButters/BioBatch", "created_at": "2014-11-04T18:39:25Z", "repo": "BioBatch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "39f9a0375c31284a16b8d7bd8f770cfb55a0495d", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2014-11-04T18:37:09Z", "repo": "BioBatch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9f9dd5e9bf231d27f009410b97b6cb611f57132c", "message": "Initial Commit", "created_at": "2014-11-05T15:39:17Z", "repo": "TuringCodes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b2e67cd8fb65915432c2b8db51e565080c5d9ddc", "message": "Restructured to facilitate different tree types", "created_at": "2014-11-07T23:06:24Z", "repo": "TTrexx", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ecdb350bd7c3632637fa3057871ca97a02750b39", "message": "Restructured for other tree types", "created_at": "2014-11-07T08:54:08Z", "repo": "TTrexx", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "382fb8a2b2235553974d04760b02a11e5798c62a", "message": "Merge branch 'master' of github.com:TimButters/TTrexx", "created_at": "2014-11-07T08:49:38Z", "repo": "TTrexx", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "312604bcb9a6a451457931791924ee25da0fea45", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2014-11-06T14:58:15Z", "repo": "TTrexx", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d16a23961f760ebcabd8618b307c6032aef561ea", "message": "Minor changes - Tidy up", "created_at": "2014-10-21T15:16:32Z", "repo": "TTrexx", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "90158806b42d6a533971e4fdd323d02fecc8eaaf", "message": "MBR is now calculated when node is split down the tree.\n\nA flag has been added (defaults to false) to specify the re-calculation\nof the nodes MBR in its parent.", "created_at": "2014-07-18T13:51:57Z", "repo": "TTrexx", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a40388052e99a7ef35d8a7404e1a4f95bab50474", "message": "Added Description to Output.\n\nThe executable now describes what is happenening at each insert.", "created_at": "2014-07-16T10:10:14Z", "repo": "TTrexx", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "518f9d1831939eb863e4aaca9746a7e3eb2a8de2", "message": "Added insert functionality and MBR subtraction.\n\nMBR subtraction works from rectangle areas. Can now insert into leaf\nnodes by extending the MBR from its parent. New entry is inserted into\nnode requiring the smallest increase in MBR area.", "created_at": "2014-07-15T10:26:16Z", "repo": "TTrexx", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "25bcc437b5aec7d75cec32a798c9a7e2b47bf4fd", "message": "Some things are working\n\nWorking insert and handles splitting the node if it overflows. The\nsecond insert after this hangs the program. The tree can be output\nvalidating the split. There is now functionality to calculate the MBR\nfrom a list of points (entries). Max and min within this function are\ncurrently doubles, this locks the tree class to numerical data, this\nmight not be a problem.", "created_at": "2014-07-14T14:52:27Z", "repo": "TTrexx", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "058164788ea715ca5d2bf368c5a79ccfea866e2c", "message": "Code Compiles\n\nImplementation of search and a basic insert. Not at a stage where these\ncan be properly tested.", "created_at": "2014-07-14T10:19:31Z", "repo": "TTrexx", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a4842c1fd6510c216095a9cc7ea97f31a507f9b5", "message": "Restructure, from scratch.\n\nNode is the base class, RTree inherits from Node. No need for abstract\nbase class, tree.h is deprecated. R+-Tree and R*-Tree can inherit from\nRTree. Working base code gives some output for proof of basic data\nstructures.", "created_at": "2014-07-04T14:28:32Z", "repo": "TTrexx", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "189404c382b51d46113d269329ad75fafb5d279a", "message": "Implementation must be in header file, but can be outside the class def.", "created_at": "2014-07-03T15:19:03Z", "repo": "TTrexx", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "04c9b398a8dcb7413a50fb00b62edd881281c031", "message": "Basic skeleton code with working test case.", "created_at": "2014-07-03T15:07:57Z", "repo": "TTrexx", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7eea14c7e5f7231a661e4240343ac96adb0e1d3e", "message": "Data for P2", "created_at": "2016-01-01T19:51:53Z", "repo": "Coursera-Regression", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ae698ae95a3b3d7c348a1b34b0581ca98ea2bf4b", "message": "Part 2 correct (Q5 wrong?)", "created_at": "2016-01-01T19:51:26Z", "repo": "Coursera-Regression", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c6b2ffab8c39f4b3d5c366870109026299043733", "message": "Week5 Part One Completed", "created_at": "2016-01-01T14:54:09Z", "repo": "Coursera-Regression", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "42e99c10a8812618a3e2840e247ed82cae256c21", "message": "Part 2 complete", "created_at": "2015-12-27T20:04:17Z", "repo": "Coursera-Regression", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bbdf105bae871eab663835ec53207da9408f1850", "message": "Week4 Part One Completed", "created_at": "2015-12-27T18:08:58Z", "repo": "Coursera-Regression", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": nul